{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_157_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "b217b3e4ecab385b6aff1b86b7839a1d14295fd60149bc8ba11495d87bec53a1", "ja": "あと『三日坊主な自分が五日続いてます！』とかも！\nいいよ～、辛い日は座ってやってもいいからね！", "zh": "还有“连三天打鱼两天晒网的我都已经坚持五天了！”之类的！\n很好哦～累的时候坐着跳也没关系！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_157_1004_p", "source_sha256": "02e950184421de7e9571b8bf3555f9b9b40f7502b2ca52eba21d239637971120", "ja": "ああ。本当に、色々な人達が見て、\n踊ってくれているみたいだ。", "zh": "啊。看来真的有很多人看了之后跟着跳了起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_157_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "a55aae713e9a476231c43afdddde59182f36d0888630e11b492c9a3f10b4f108", "ja": "それとね！　収録で一緒だったあの男の子が、\n体操の動画をアップしてくれてたの！", "zh": "还有哦！和我们一起录节目的那个男孩子，把体操视频上传了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_157_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "fba59e7e411918d1674439c1a7f877b85480bb4b4a00b64a8b4e179592091ad6", "ja": "あの子の事務所が、動画チャンネル持ってて……\nしかもセンター！　振り付けもほとんど完璧！", "zh": "那个男孩子的事务所自己有视频频道……\n而且他还是C位！动作编排也几乎完美无缺！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_157_1007_p", "source_sha256": "79d8acf984b14de8c16d3b885b12e596c49bccee2347118dc8b58e3269217cb0", "ja": "もちろん見たよ。\n手足の長さを活かしてて、見せ方も上手かったな。", "zh": "当然看过了。\n她充分发挥了四肢修长的优势，展现方式也很棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_157_1008_p", "source_sha256": "7ec0ac757169f8cc6750217c2569a96559c9d775f7a49f4dd2fd16f2d1c6c3fa", "ja": "苦手意識があったなんて信じられないよ。\nさすがは海美直伝、だな！", "zh": "真不敢相信你以前居然对这个有畏惧心理。果然是海美亲自教出来的啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_157_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_157_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "2b950251c24008a3d616d8286b94ecf257b20624a3f586dfccfbdcb3173b53dc", "ja": "えへへ～♪　私、毎日みんなの動画\n見ちゃって、時間が足りないくらい！", "zh": "嘿嘿～♪我每天都忍不住看大家的视频，简直连时间都不够用了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
